sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant MBX as Shared mailbox<br/>(Outlook)
    participant PA as Power Automate<br/>cloud flow
    participant KV as Azure Key Vault<br/>(shared secret)
    participant AGW as GCP API Gateway<br/>public HTTPS endpoint
    participant CR as Cloud Run<br/>new-deal-review-agent<br/>(no-allow-unauthenticated)
    participant SM as Secret Manager
    participant FS as Firestore

    Note over MBX,FS: How Power Automate reaches a private Cloud Run service

    MBX->>PA: trigger "When a new email arrives"<br/>(standard Outlook connector)
    PA->>PA: filter on subject / sender rule
    PA->>KV: read shared secret
    KV-->>PA: secret

    PA->>PA: build body = {messageId, subject, body,<br/>receivedDateTime, attachments[]}
    PA->>PA: timestamp = now (RFC3339)<br/>signature = HMAC-SHA256(secret, timestamp + "." + body)

    PA->>AGW: POST /events/mail  [PREMIUM HTTP action]<br/>x-api-key, X-NDRA-Timestamp,<br/>X-NDRA-Signature, X-NDRA-Event-Id

    AGW->>AGW: validate x-api-key, apply quota
    AGW->>CR: forward with Google OIDC token<br/>minted from the gateway service account
    CR->>CR: Cloud Run IAM accepts the OIDC token<br/>(this is what keeps the service private)

    CR->>SM: read shared secret (cached)
    SM-->>CR: secret
    CR->>CR: recompute HMAC, compare with hmac.compare_digest
    CR->>CR: reject if timestamp older than 5 minutes (replay guard)

    CR->>FS: has X-NDRA-Event-Id been seen?
    alt already processed
        FS-->>CR: yes
        CR-->>AGW: 200 OK (no-op, idempotent)
    else new event
        FS-->>CR: no
        CR->>FS: record event, create or load deal case
        CR-->>AGW: 202 Accepted
        Note right of CR: work is enqueued to Cloud Tasks,<br/>never done inline, so the flow<br/>gets a fast response
    end

    AGW-->>PA: 202 Accepted

    alt non-2xx or timeout
        PA->>PA: retry policy, exponential, 4 attempts
        Note over PA,CR: If every retry fails the scheduled<br/>Graph poll still picks the email up.<br/>Push is an accelerator, not the only path.
    end
